# Command-backed map authoring toolbar. Buttons only select a generic tool or
# execute an existing canonical Inti command; map data remains plugin-owned.
plugin import-set inti-chasqui
author start inti-map-placement-toolbar
inti map create toolbar-map "../../../exports/sprites/templates/User Level Up LLC Logo.png"
author button bind Node author placement arm node map-node inti map node add {name} {x} {y}
author button bind Power-up author placement arm powerup map-powerup inti map powerup add {name} {x} {y} courier-boost
author button bind Link author placement link path inti map path add {a} {b}
author button bind Exit author placement arm exit map-exit inti map exit add {name} {x} {y} next.intimap
author button bind Save inti map save authoring/map-placement-toolbar.intimap
author button bind Cancel author placement cancel
author button show